        "# Abstract base class\n",
        "\n",
        "An abstract base class (ABC) defines an interface for subclasses and can require them to implement abstract methods. ABCs can also recognize registered virtual subclasses.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-abstract-base-class)"
      ]
    }
